      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since your 14-month-old has diarrhea and hasn't urinated in a while, it's very important to focus on proper rehydration, not just juice. While apple juice and coconut water are okay in small amounts, the best fluid for diarrhea is an oral rehydration solution (ORS) like Pedialyte. If you are concerned about dehydration, especially with decreased urination, you should contact an urgent care clinic or nurse line immediately for professional guidance.",
